cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "meiosim: a toolbox to simulate crosses and play with quantitative genetics in Python "
abstract: >
  meiosim provides a single, lightweight data structure that bundles
  genotypes, individual metadata and a genetic map together. It includes
  the operations breeders and quantitative geneticists reach for most often:
  basic data manipulation, simulating meiosis and crosses, and a ready-to-use
  Arabidopsis thaliana panel.
